WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:11.070
As is known to all, gaining a sound knowledge of the basics is of vital importance for students to master an academic subject.
众所周知，扎实地掌握基础知识，对学生学好一门学科至关重要。

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:19.940
Just as a tall building cannot stand without a solid foundation, advanced study is impossible without a firm grasp of the fundamentals.
正如高楼没有坚实的地基就无法屹立，没有牢固掌握基础知识，深入的学习也就无从谈起。

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:28.020
Whether it is mathematics, physics or a foreign language, every subject is built on a set of basic concepts and skills.
无论是数学、物理还是外语，每门学科都建立在一套基本概念和技能之上。

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.820
The basics matter for two reasons.
基础知识之所以重要，有两个原因。

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:34.700
First, they are the building blocks of more complex knowledge.
第一，它们是更复杂知识的基石。

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:44.930
A student who has not mastered basic English grammar and vocabulary, for example, will find it almost impossible to read academic papers in English.
例如，一个没有掌握基本英语语法和词汇的学生，会发现几乎不可能读懂英文学术论文。

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:49.740
Second, a solid foundation makes further learning easier and faster.
第二，扎实的基础使后续学习更容易、更快速。

00:00:50.540 --> 00:01:02.620
Students who truly understand the basic concepts of mathematics can apply them flexibly to new problems, whereas those who merely memorize formulas often get lost when a question is slightly changed.
真正理解数学基本概念的学生能把它们灵活地运用到新问题上，而那些只会死记公式的学生，往往题目稍一变化就不知所措。

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:10.070
Unfortunately, some students, impatient for quick results, skip the basics to tackle difficult problems.
遗憾的是，有些学生急于求成，跳过基础知识去攻克难题。

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:19.440
To avoid this, they should be patient, review the fundamentals regularly and make sure that they understand them rather than merely memorize them.
为了避免这种情况，他们应该保持耐心，定期复习基础知识，并确保自己是真正理解了这些知识，而不只是死记硬背。

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:27.540
Teachers can also help by emphasizing core concepts in class and checking that students have mastered them before moving on.
教师也可以提供帮助：在课堂上强调核心概念，并在确认学生已经掌握之后再往下讲。

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:33.180
With strong fundamentals, students can go much further in their academic pursuits.
有了扎实的基础，学生在学业上就能走得更远。
